# DRTrial core

- Workspace root must be `DRTrial` (`C:\Users\docra\Projects\DRTrial`), not other repos.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `data/DATASETS_STATUS.md` before multi-step work.
- Validation uses **UWF IQA only** unless the user explicitly revisits UWF4DR/CodaLab.

## Docker

- Rebuild after ML/API changes: `docker compose up -d --build api worker`
- Code is in the image; only `data/`, `ml/weights/`, and `docs/` are bind-mounted.
- Long benchmarks: `docker compose exec worker python -m ml.evaluation.benchmark ...`

## Git / data

- Do not commit `data/raw/` or `data/processed/`.
- Do not read or summarize multi-GB raw image folders.

## Clinical (non-negotiable)

- Macula remains in exudate/DME analysis — no macula exclusion masks.
- Macular atrophy downgrades false DR via `apply_atrophy_grading_context()`; DME logic unchanged.

## Commits

- Only commit when the user explicitly asks.
